493D:  38          sec
493E:  FD F1 02    sbc SRANG,x                  ; GET ABS(TARGET-CURRENT)
4941:  85 12       sta R2                       ; SAVE SIGN
4943:  10 02       bpl ATTACK_11                ; OK
4945:  49 FF       eor #$FF                     ; NEGATE IT

ATTACK_11:
